@ 10.3.11.3.5 - Proto-Tanna to Whitesands
# citation: thetha, from Lynch, John (2001), The Linguistic History of Southern Vanuatu kʷ / {w,u}
	r > {l,i}
	d > r / _ŋ (occasionally elsewhere as well)
	b(ʷ) d > p(ʷ) t
	kʷ > ∅ / u_
	kʷ > ∅ / _u
	ɣ > ∅ / {#,E}_
	ɣ > ∅ / _E
	ɣ > ŋ
	c *j > s {z,s}
	s > h “often”
